  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Third EU-PNG Business, Trade and Investment Conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective of the project of which this contract will be a part is to stimulate more trade and investment between the EU and Papua New Guinea +5 (Fiji, Samoa, Solomon Islands, Tonga and Timor Leste) supporting as well PNG+5 integration into the regional and global economy and, thereby, contribute to sustainable economic development and poverty reduction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;This service contract is to organise the logistics of the third EU-PNG Business, Trade &amp;amp; Investment Conference to be organised during October 2022. Dates for the event may change due to the impact of COVID-19 related restrictions.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
